575
00:25:18,559 --> 00:25:20,079
I will care for her like my own son,

576
00:25:20,079 --> 00:25:21,440
like my own grandson.

577
00:25:21,599 --> 00:25:23,119
I'll take good care of Ding Ning,

578
00:25:23,880 --> 00:25:25,440
