579
00:25:27,200 --> 00:25:28,240
What kind of person am I?

580
00:25:29,079 --> 00:25:30,640
An honest bad guy.

581
00:25:31,279 --> 00:25:32,119
And what about you?

582
00:25:33,359 --> 00:25:35,160
You played the good guy for so long,

583
00:25:35,599 --> 00:25:37,559
