586
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:43,240
Doesn't she want to live like she is now?

587
00:25:43,480 --> 00:25:46,880
Then why abandon the Sham Litigation Factory

588
00:25:46,880 --> 00:25:48,759
and leave Fuxia Group alone?

589
00:25:53,359 --> 00:25:54,880
Because if sacrifices are inevitable,

590
00:25:56,039 --> 00:25:57,359
