596
00:26:11,359 --> 00:26:12,000
Impressive.

597
00:26:13,279 --> 00:26:15,319
So if they found out

598
00:26:15,720 --> 00:26:19,160
you were running sham litigation for Fuxia Group,

599
00:26:19,160 --> 00:26:21,160
using the basement here,

600
00:26:21,240 --> 00:26:22,599
and then they would Follow the clues

601
00:26:22,599 --> 00:26:23,599
and trace it to that team leader,

602
00:26:23,599 --> 00:26:24,319
and then suspect

603
00:26:24,319 --> 00:26:27,119
