604
00:26:34,880 --> 00:26:35,480
Hello?

605
00:26:36,480 --> 00:26:37,160
Old Kong.

606
00:26:38,599 --> 00:26:39,279
Okay. Okay.

607
00:26:39,279 --> 00:26:40,599
Thanks for your trouble.

608
00:26:42,480 --> 00:26:43,480
