615
00:26:56,000 --> 00:26:56,720
Don't mention it.

616
00:26:57,759 --> 00:26:58,880
After all,

617
00:27:01,519 --> 00:27:03,319
I'm a father too.

618
00:27:06,359 --> 00:27:07,759
Okay, talk to you later.

619
