623
00:27:31,240 --> 00:27:31,880
Right.

624
00:27:32,039 --> 00:27:33,640
It got to this stage before my business trip.

625
00:27:34,079 --> 00:27:35,160
According to the regulations,

626
00:27:36,039 --> 00:27:37,920
and responding to the higher-ups' call

627
00:27:38,240 --> 00:27:40,720
to implement the criminal justice policy to

628
00:27:40,720 --> 00:27:42,039
arrest less, prosecute cautiously, detain prudently.

629
00:27:42,119 --> 00:27:42,839
So it was decided

630
00:27:42,839 --> 00:27:44,799
