655
00:28:19,359 --> 00:28:20,880
Is it money I want?

656
00:28:20,880 --> 00:28:23,319
I want a satisfactory resolution.

657
00:28:23,839 --> 00:28:24,880
She's been here four days in a row.

658
00:28:25,160 --> 00:28:26,759
But this kid hasn't stolen anything.

659
00:28:26,839 --> 00:28:28,359
Even if we include the damaged lock,

660
