666
00:28:36,240 --> 00:28:37,039
Let me tell you,

667
00:28:37,160 --> 00:28:39,160
I can't sleep at all at night now.

668
00:28:39,279 --> 00:28:40,640
Whenever a branch rustles outside my window,

669
00:28:40,680 --> 00:28:41,839
I get terrified.

670
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:44,200
And yet you just let him go?

671
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:45,000
No way.

672
00:28:45,119 --> 00:28:46,920
No matter what you say today,

673
00:28:46,960 --> 00:28:48,759
