675
00:28:50,079 --> 00:28:51,160
Sentence him, of course!

676
00:28:51,319 --> 00:28:54,039
He needs to have a criminal record for life!

677
00:28:54,039 --> 00:28:55,480
Firstly, to teach him a lesson.

678
00:28:55,480 --> 00:28:56,200
Secondly,

679
00:28:56,200 --> 00:28:57,519
to warn the whole society

680
00:28:57,519 --> 00:28:59,000
