685
00:29:07,599 --> 00:29:08,640
Who are you?

686
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:10,519
I'm a police officer here.

687
00:29:10,640 --> 00:29:11,519
My name is Fan Dong.

688
00:29:12,240 --> 00:29:13,279
