But don't take it out of context.

693
00:29:22,960 --> 00:29:23,640
Go ahead.

694
00:29:24,279 --> 00:29:26,119
We police must enforce the law by the book.

695
00:29:26,359 --> 00:29:28,400
However, we can also understand you.

696
00:29:28,680 --> 00:29:29,839
You left home alone

697
00:29:29,839 --> 00:29:31,680
and work hard in this city. It's not easy.

698
00:29:31,680 --> 00:29:33,000
It's normal to be scared of danger.

699
00:29:33,000 --> 00:29:33,480
Therefore,

700
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:35,160
