703
00:29:37,599 --> 00:29:39,400
Every time I visit that kid's house,

704
00:29:39,400 --> 00:29:40,759
I'll give you an update.

705
00:29:41,039 --> 00:29:42,319
If I fail to do so,

706
00:29:42,599 --> 00:29:44,119
