Come here.

713
00:30:15,319 --> 00:30:17,160
Why are you running? I don't bite.

714
00:30:17,519 --> 00:30:19,079
I didn't go to anyone else's house.

715
00:30:19,519 --> 00:30:20,319
I know.

716
00:30:21,359 --> 00:30:22,680
I brought you something good.

717
00:30:28,400 --> 00:30:29,440
A wheelchair.

718
00:30:38,319 --> 00:30:39,039
Try it out.

719
00:30:43,960 --> 00:30:44,680
Not bad.

720
00:30:48,799 --> 00:30:49,720
That's great!

721
00:31:09,720 --> 00:31:10,880
After your dad's accident,

722
00:31:11,039 --> 00:31:12,400
他们没赔钱给你们

723
00:31:13,680 --> 00:31:14,480
They said

724
00:31:14,759 --> 00:31:16,480
my dad didn't fall during work hours,

725
00:31:17,440 --> 00:31:18,839
