726
00:31:19,000 --> 00:31:20,039
And nothing else.

727
00:31:22,720 --> 00:31:23,559
That's unreasonable.

728
00:31:24,640 --> 00:31:25,480
My mom said

729
00:31:25,640 --> 00:31:26,759
