731
00:31:30,759 --> 00:31:31,759
But if we didn't,

732
00:31:33,440 --> 00:31:34,519
they'd let us keep working

733
00:31:34,599 --> 00:31:35,720
and still pay our wages.

734
00:31:41,640 --> 00:31:42,240
Here.

735
00:31:46,119 --> 00:31:48,319
Lu, remember our deal.

736
00:31:48,480 --> 00:31:50,039
If you pick locks to break into people's homes again...

737
00:31:50,039 --> 00:31:50,880
I won't, ever.

738
00:31:54,039 --> 00:31:54,759
Or if you do

739
00:31:54,759 --> 00:31:56,440
