741
00:32:04,640 --> 00:32:05,559
Have something to eat yourself.

742
00:32:17,799 --> 00:32:19,480
Hungry? Eat up.

743
00:32:19,599 --> 00:32:20,279
Uncle Fan,

744
00:32:21,519 --> 00:32:22,799
