Fake what?

752
00:32:41,920 --> 00:32:42,640
Nothing.

753
00:32:47,519 --> 00:32:49,319
That doesn't sound like anything good.

754
00:33:23,559 --> 00:33:24,279
Hello?

755
00:33:46,599 --> 00:33:47,359
Hello.

756
00:33:50,200 --> 00:33:51,920
We managed to get a court hearing

757
00:33:52,319 --> 00:33:54,160
