758
00:33:54,319 --> 00:33:55,039
Yes, exactly.

759
00:33:55,039 --> 00:33:57,119
That female lawyer of yours

760
00:33:57,279 --> 00:33:58,079
had nothing to do with it.

761
00:33:58,920 --> 00:34:00,079
In today's society,

762
00:34:00,279 --> 00:34:01,839
if you don't have connections,

763
00:34:01,839 --> 00:34:02,839
