764
00:34:03,200 --> 00:34:03,880
Understood. Understood.

765
00:34:03,880 --> 00:34:04,839
You shouldn't say that.

766
00:34:05,240 --> 00:34:07,160
We shouldn't talk about people behind their backs.

767
00:34:07,160 --> 00:34:07,599
Right?

768
00:34:07,599 --> 00:34:08,920
After all, we're in the same profession.

769
00:34:08,920 --> 00:34:10,800
We have to let them make a living too.

770
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:11,519
Right?

771
00:34:11,559 --> 00:34:12,320
No matter what,

772
00:34:12,320 --> 00:34:14,519
