776
00:34:18,840 --> 00:34:20,239
Take a look.

777
00:34:20,559 --> 00:34:21,199
Okay, okay.

778
00:34:21,199 --> 00:34:22,039
Have a look.

779
00:34:22,480 --> 00:34:23,400
That won't do.

780
00:34:24,320 --> 00:34:25,079
It's fine, it's fine.

781
00:34:25,079 --> 00:34:26,280
I trust Attorney Song.

782
00:34:26,280 --> 00:34:27,719
I trust Attorney Song completely.

783
00:34:31,840 --> 00:34:32,800
Attorney Song.

784
00:34:33,000 --> 00:34:35,119
