785
00:34:35,119 --> 00:34:35,679
Yes.

786
00:34:35,679 --> 00:34:37,760
Could we find a chance to get together?

787
00:34:37,760 --> 00:34:38,760
We could have a meal.

788
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:40,760
Here's the thing.

789
00:34:41,000 --> 00:34:42,280
If the two of us meet,

790
00:34:42,360 --> 00:34:43,679
