794
00:34:47,719 --> 00:34:48,519
Right.

795
00:34:49,400 --> 00:34:50,239
It's too abrupt.

796
00:34:50,239 --> 00:34:52,719
Right, I was just a little anxious.

797
00:34:52,800 --> 00:34:55,280
How about this? We terminate our contract with Ding Ning

798
00:34:55,280 --> 00:34:56,800
