799
00:34:56,800 --> 00:34:58,679
Sure, full representation.

800
00:34:58,840 --> 00:35:00,360
There's really no need for that.

801
00:35:00,360 --> 00:35:02,000
Keep her around. Just consider it

802
00:35:02,000 --> 00:35:04,360
