803
00:35:05,760 --> 00:35:06,440
Does that sound good?

804
00:35:06,440 --> 00:35:07,360
Sure, sure.

805
00:35:07,559 --> 00:35:09,400
Okay, whatever you say.

806
00:35:13,679 --> 00:35:15,880
The weather is really nice today!

807
00:35:24,559 --> 00:35:25,239
Thank you.

808
00:35:29,559 --> 00:35:33,400
Wait, even if the appeals judge is his classmate,

809
00:35:33,599 --> 00:35:34,480
would this case just...

810
00:35:34,480 --> 00:35:35,920
