813
00:35:42,280 --> 00:35:45,039
A lawyer who treats our profession like a scam.

814
00:35:47,559 --> 00:35:48,719
Wait, buddy, why are you just getting here?

815
00:35:48,719 --> 00:35:50,039
Are you done? Are you done?

816
00:35:50,159 --> 00:35:51,920
Because this place is poorly planned.

817
00:35:51,920 --> 00:35:52,480
Right?

818
00:35:52,480 --> 00:35:53,840
