825
00:36:08,480 --> 00:36:09,159
Fine.

826
00:36:09,840 --> 00:36:11,559
Then get out, I'll drive.

827
00:36:11,960 --> 00:36:12,519
Come on.

828
00:36:15,280 --> 00:36:16,239
He hasn't arrived yet.

829
00:36:16,239 --> 00:36:17,119
Then what is your job?

830
00:36:17,119 --> 00:36:18,480
