831
00:36:18,639 --> 00:36:20,360
Isn't your job to watch the cars?

832
00:36:20,360 --> 00:36:21,880
Aren't you in charge of coordinating?

833
00:36:21,880 --> 00:36:22,440
Right?

834
00:36:31,280 --> 00:36:31,920
Who is it?

835
00:36:32,559 --> 00:36:33,320
Who is it?!

836
00:36:33,360 --> 00:36:34,559
How do you even drive?!

837
00:36:35,199 --> 00:36:37,039
Sorry, couldn't brake in time.

838
00:36:39,719 --> 00:36:41,000
If you need anything,

839
00:36:41,719 --> 00:36:42,280
