840
00:37:04,159 --> 00:37:05,079
This is terrifying!

841
00:37:07,960 --> 00:37:08,880
Zhao Yijie!

842
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:16,239
Zhao Yijie, what are you doing?!

843
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:18,559
Slow down!

844
00:37:18,559 --> 00:37:19,760
Are you crazy?!

845
00:37:20,280 --> 00:37:21,079
Stop the car!

846
00:37:21,880 --> 00:37:23,559
Zhao Yijie, stop the car now!

847
00:37:55,320 --> 00:37:56,599
What were you thinking?

848
00:37:56,760 --> 00:37:58,360
That didn't make me feel better at all.

849
00:37:59,719 --> 00:38:00,599
Don't flatter yourself.

850
00:38:01,800 --> 00:38:03,440
I just hate that guy Song.

851
00:38:05,199 --> 00:38:07,719
It's normal Mrs. Lin can't tell good lawyers from bad ones.

852
00:38:07,719 --> 00:38:09,159
She added another lawyer to win her case,

853
00:38:09,159 --> 00:38:10,320
which is her right.

854
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:12,519
Just because you couldn't control the situation,

855
00:38:12,519 --> 00:38:13,719
you crashed into someone's car?

856
00:38:14,000 --> 00:38:15,400
That's what isn't normal.

857
00:38:15,840 --> 00:38:17,599
Just taking you out for some fun.

858
00:38:19,320 --> 00:38:21,559
You're so young, yet more rigid than Old Yu.

859
00:38:21,559 --> 00:38:22,360
Fun?

860
00:38:23,159 --> 00:38:24,039
I bet in two hours,

861
00:38:24,039 --> 00:38:24,880
every law firm in the city will know

862
00:38:24,880 --> 00:38:26,719
what kind of shady thing you did. Fun?

863
00:38:27,199 --> 00:38:29,159
Even if I gave that guy Song the courage,

864
00:38:29,760 --> 00:38:31,639
let's see if he'd dare breathe a word of this.

865
00:38:32,559 --> 00:38:35,239
But just now, did you get a hint of

866
00:38:35,320 --> 00:38:37,960
that thrill when you want to do something but don't dare,

867
00:38:38,519 --> 00:38:40,679
and I make it happen for you?

868
00:38:43,440 --> 00:38:44,559
That satisfaction?

869
00:38:50,400 --> 00:38:52,360
Not even a little bit.

870
00:38:54,679 --> 00:38:55,639
Just a little?

871
00:39:05,639 --> 00:39:06,400
None at all?

872
00:39:16,599 --> 00:39:17,440
Not happy?
